WEBVTT

NOTE
Prologue narration (Inspector Jenks), transcribed from the game's own audio.
Times are absolute positions in gfx/MCMV.mp4 (the prologue runs 0:18 to 3:08).
prepare.cjs merges these cues into the packaged sub.vtt.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.100 align:middle size:56%
My name is Jenks, Detective Inspector Frederick Jenks, and I've been assigned to a last-minute

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:33.780 align:middle size:56%
investigation into the death of Kate Vine, a PhD student found drowned at midnight last

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:38.780 align:middle size:56%
Friday in a lake in the woods on the outskirts of the tiny village of Edenton.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:44.060 align:middle size:56%
I have until first thing tomorrow morning to decide whether her death was a simple accident

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.100 align:middle size:56%
or whether this was murder.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:53.920 align:middle size:56%
Kate Vine appeared to the world to be a bright, confident, fun-loving PhD student with everything to live for.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:59.560 align:middle size:56%
However, a history of depression and alcoholism revealed in her medical records suggests that

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:03.640 align:middle size:56%
in reality she had become adept at hiding behind a mask.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:08.440 align:middle size:56%
A lab report indicating a high level of alcohol in her blood along with the late hour of her

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:13.440 align:middle size:56%
death and a lack of witnesses makes a strong case that this was suicide.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:17.180 align:middle size:56%
But the verdict overlooked some curious details.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.040 align:middle size:56%
Why was her driving licence found on the opposite side of the lake in which she drowned?

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.440 align:middle size:56%
Also, there were traces of morphine in Kate's system.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.320 align:middle size:56%
Where did she get it?

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:32.520 align:middle size:56%
Kate was known to be a free spirit with a nihilistic love of danger, which may in part

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:36.920 align:middle size:56%
have something to do with a business course called Atlas, which Kate had joined and which

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:39.400 align:middle size:56%
she had been attending on the night of her death.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:44.320 align:middle size:56%
Based in a large, stately home on the outskirts of the village, the exclusive Atlas is run

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.720 align:middle size:56%
by father and son team Paul and Ryan Rand.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:52.920 align:middle size:56%
Both were interviewed following Kate's death, but neither claimed to have seen Kate after

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:59.180 align:middle size:56%
the meeting and both were understandably eager to distance themselves and Atlas from the tragedy.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.300 align:middle size:56%
This isn't the first time that Atlas has been investigated.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:08.980 align:middle size:56%
Atlas and their questionable methods, which many have suggested border on mind control.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:14.400 align:middle size:56%
Ryan is married to Rebecca, landlady of Edenton's village pub, the George and Dragon.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.880 align:middle size:56%
As yet, she hasn't been interviewed, though it's likely Kate visited the pub on more than one occasion.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:25.380 align:middle size:56%
One of Kate's friends was Emma Bowman, who lives at Eden Lodge on the road leading out

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.160 align:middle size:56%
of Edenton Village.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:32.360 align:middle size:56%
Emma was also doing a PhD at the same university, but didn't attend Atlas.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:37.920 align:middle size:56%
Interviewed after Kate's death, Emma seemed shocked and upset, insisting she hadn't seen Kate that night.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.160 align:middle size:56%
However, it turned out her boyfriend had.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.040 align:middle size:56%
Simon Thompson met Emma at university.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:49.040 align:middle size:56%
After completing his degree around 18 months ago, he went to work at a shop in the neighbouring village.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.780 align:middle size:56%
He started at the Atlas course a few months ago.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:57.120 align:middle size:56%
Simon insisted that he didn't see Kate after the meeting, but the sergeant interviewing

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:04.040 align:middle size:56%
him noted he seemed oddly unmoved by her death, which makes him the first person I want to see tonight.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.500 align:middle size:56%
It's time for some answers.
